/// Workflow whose body raises (BT-3961).
///
/// Used by WorkflowEngineTest to verify that a raising workflow is
/// recorded as failed instead of crashing its runner.
///
/// ## Examples
/// ```beamtalk
/// engine startWorkflow: FailingWorkflow id: "wf-1" args: #("boom")
/// // Execution status becomes #failed with result "boom"
/// ```
Workflow subclass: FailingWorkflow

  /// Raise an Error carrying the input as its message.
  class run: input :: String ctx: _ctx :: WorkflowContext -> Object =>
    Error signal: input
